   "heading": {
    "en": "Citation and commencement"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "1. This Order is the Infrastructure Protection (Protected Places) (No. 5) Order 2020 and comes into operation on 7 April 2020."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "SG-H2714-A2",
   "no": 2,
   "noLabel": {
    "en": "2."
   },
   "heading": {
    "en": "Premises declared to be protected place and surrounding area"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "2.—(1) The premises described in the second column of Part 1 of the Schedule are declared to be a protected place for the purposes of the Act, and the person specified in the first column of Part 1 of that Schedule is designated as the authority of the protected place.\n(2) The premises described in Part 2 of the Schedule are specified to be the surrounding area of the protected place for the purposes of sections 27 and 28 of the Act."
   }
  },
  {
