   "heading": {
    "en": "Amendment of Protected Places (No. 5) Order 2007"
   },
   "text": {
    "en": "3. Item (7) of the Schedule to the Protected Places (No. 5) Order 2007 (G.N. No. S 485/2007) is deleted."
   }
